  "description": "TopiaDesk CRM shared design system — shadcn/ui-based primitives + brand tokens, consumed by frontend/web (and future apps) via the workspace protocol. Ships raw TS/TSX source (no build step) — consumers must transpile it (Next.js: add to `transpilePackages`).",
